@HostAddress = http://localhost:5208

### Hämta alla kunder
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

### Hämta en kund med ordrar
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### Skapa kund
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

